Subject: [PATCH 09/42] feat(amdgpu): prove gfx950 decoder aliases

Add gfx942/gfx950 literal FMA decoder aliases and reset shared ISA overrides before each selection. Retain the bounded decoder and host-state regression evidence; this does not claim generic HSACO execution.

